{"anomaly_threshold":50,"author":["Elastic"],"description":"机器学习：罕见 RDP 用户名登录。对应需求：异常账号使用 / 远程登录审计。","false_positives":["厂商远程支持或偶发排障"],"from":"now-45m","interval":"15m","license":"Elastic License v2","machine_learning_job_id":["v3_windows_rare_user_type10_remote_login_ea"],"name":"【默认】Windows异常远程桌面用户（机器学习）","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n出现相对基线罕见的 RDP 用户。\n\n### 为何重要\n可能是账号接管，也可能是厂商远程支持。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认该用户是否属于常态 RDP 组。\n2. 核对源地址是否为办公网/VPN。\n3. 关联特权登录 4672。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"1781d055-5c66-4adf-9e93-fc0fa69550c9","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用对应数据源（Elastic Defend / System / Windows / auditd，按规则说明）。\n2. 机器学习规则需关联 ML job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: 登录审计"],"type":"machine_learning","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.001","name":"Remote Desktop Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"version":312,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"fie